Add the shared Remote Query runtime for the Postgres and ClickHouse integrations: request contracts, producer diagnostics, bounded source-page uploads, and an intake upload client addressing sessions by upload_id with the org API and application keys, answering page handoffs on 202 acceptance receipts, bounding upload retries by the run-wide deadline, finalizing with bounded pending polling, stamping every page with the agent-reported hostname under the RFC contract_version 1 format (run id serialized as crawl_id, bare data array, no batch_index in the body), carrying producer execution diagnostics on final and error events, and propagating the Agent trace context as distributed-tracing headers on every upload request.